[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_01_0010","text":"嗯～？\n这件衣服，是谁的～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_01_0020","text":"好豪华啊～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_01_0030","text":"嗯\n那是雏菜的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_01_0040","text":"诶～！？\n这是雏菜的～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_01_0050","text":"嗯，今天因为服装做好了所以叫了你来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_01_0060","text":"啊哈～\n好厉害～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_01_0070","text":"穿上试试吧\n也想确认一下活动方不方便"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_01_0080","text":"嗯～！\n我去那边换！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_01_0090","text":"制片人\n要好好期待哦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_01_0100","text":"哈哈，好的！"}]
